<body>
  <p>The safe range for depth values is <span data-keyref="Const_Depth_Min">-16000</span> to <span data-keyref="Const_Depth_Max">16000</span>. Outside of this range, instances may still be drawn, depending on the target platform. It&#39;s recommended to keep depth values within this range to ensure they are visible on all platforms. Instances that are not drawn still process their events.</p>
</body>
